{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Cats CCG</i> is a <strong>strategic digital card game</strong> where each card represents an <strong>anthropomorphic cats</strong>. Build your deck, master powerful abilities, and challenge opponents in <strong>tactical duels</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>The cards</strong><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3523490/extras/Cats_CCG_Cards.gif?t=1745238328\" /><strong>Play rare magic to dominate the board.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3523490/extras/Cats_CCG_Poison_Magic.gif?t=1745238328\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Deck trainer to easily test new builds.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3523490/extras/Cats_CCG_Deck_Builder.gif?t=1745238328\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\ud83c\udfb4 Key Features:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udc3e <strong>Collect &amp; Battle</strong> \u2013 Assemble a deck of <strong>legendary cat heroes</strong> with unique abilities.<br>\ud83c\udfad <strong>Anthropomorphic Cats</strong> \u2013 Every card embodies a real-world historical or cultural icon\u2014re-imagined as a cat!<br>\ud83e\udde0 <strong>Deep Strategy</strong> \u2013 Balance <strong>resource management, attack power, and health</strong> to outsmart your opponents.<br>\u2694\ufe0f <strong>Turn-Based Duels</strong> \u2013 Engage in <strong>fast-paced tactical battles</strong>, where every move matters.<br>\ud83c\udf0d <strong>Global Modifiers &amp; Abilities</strong> \u2013 Cast spells, use buffs, and unleash special effects to dominate the battlefield.<br>\ud83d\udee1\ufe0f <strong>Single &amp; Multiplayer</strong> \u2013 Challenge AI or test your skills against real players in <strong>PvP battles</strong>.<br>\ud83c\udfa8 <strong>Hand-Painted Artwork</strong> \u2013 Stunning card designs bring the feline champions to life.<br>\ud83d\udca1 <strong>Easy to Learn, Hard to Master</strong> \u2013 Accessible gameplay with <strong>deep deck-building mechanics</strong>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\ud83d\udc3e Become the Ultimate Cat Commander!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Whether you're a <strong>casual player</strong> or a <strong>hardcore strategist</strong>, <i>Cats of the Arcane</i> offers an immersive experience with endless replayability. Will you craft the <strong>purr-fect deck</strong> and claim victory?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Add to your <strong>wishlist now</strong> and prepare for the <strong>ultimate feline duel!</strong> \ud83d\udc08\u2728</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3523490?t=1745238328","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3523490/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1745238328","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3523490/9b01f3bb8262cf48e802175d1c80239489c64889/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745238328","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3523490/9b01f3bb8262cf48e802175d1c80239489c64889/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745238328","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Cross-Platform Multiplayer","id":27},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Cats CCG</i> is a <strong>strategic digital card game</strong> where each card represents an <strong>anthropomorphic cats</strong>. Build your deck, master powerful abilities, and challenge opponents in <strong>tactical duels</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>The cards</strong><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https: